{"message":"Success","data":{"uuid":"N2733289","newswiz_id":"2733289","published_at":1795327830,"tags":[],"main_tag":null,"category":{"id":7,"name":"Tourism and entertainment","is_main":1,"is_followed":false,"is_notify":false},"country":{"id":1,"name":"Saudi Arabia"},"city":{"id":25,"name":"Jazan","country_id":1},"default_image_url":null,"locale":"en","title":"Jazan's Waterfronts, Green Spaces Enrich Options for Leisure During Autumn Break","subtitle":null,"content":"Jizan, November 22, 2026, SPA -- As the autumn break begins, Jazan Region is welcoming visitors with a diverse range of leisure and recreational opportunities, most notably its Red Sea waterfronts and lush green spaces.\n    The waterfront in Jizan stands out as a premier destination, combining a beautiful setting with a wide variety of facilities. Spanning approximately one million square meters, it features open spaces, landscaped greenery, pedestrian walkways, sports courts, children’s play areas, and public plazas.\n    Along the waterfront, a seaside promenade offers expansive space for walking and jogging, while seating areas and rest spots provide direct views of the Red Sea, making it a popular destination for families, photography enthusiasts, and anyone looking to enjoy a peaceful time outdoors.\n    -- SPA\r\n09:10 Local Time 06:10 GMT\r\n0011","hashtags":[{"id":2208,"name":"Red Sea","locale":"en","created_at":"2024-01-29T07:56:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2024-01-29T07:56:40.000000Z"},{"id":4422,"name":"Jazan region","locale":"en","created_at":"2024-04-30T07:47:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2024-04-30T07:47:26.000000Z"},{"id":103878,"name":"Autumn break","locale":"en","created_at":"2026-11-18T13:36:59.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:36:59.000000Z"},{"id":105105,"name":"Waterfronts","locale":"en","created_at":"2026-11-22T06:10:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:10:40.000000Z"}],"royal_news_types":[],"date_hijri":"1448-06-12","is_report":false,"related_news":[],"parent_news":null,"report_ta